{"time": 1772629284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871362801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "588162808", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那个乱蓬蓬棕色短发的青年，向浅上鞠了一躬“不打扰医生你了”"}
