{"time": 1772631476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "297012561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "588162808", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“嗨~这么巧呀”"}
{"time": 1772631522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380091085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "588162808", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“姐姐”走到真有理身边，“我来拿哥哥的检查报告”"}
{"time": 1772631582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1238845625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "588162808", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“又一起自杀，唉……”习惯性地取出一支烟，想到这里是医院，又塞了回去"}
{"time": 1772631614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135831434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "588162808", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“自杀？难道‘自杀病’的事情是真的？”"}
{"time": 1772631709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896292233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "588162808", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "敲一下若叶的头“不信谣不传谣”"}
{"time": 1772631716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229957193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "588162808", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯....什么事都没有。\"皱眉，\"我每次都想为什么要这么频繁来检查\""}
{"time": 1772631730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1334607654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "588162808", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*看着若叶茜“和UFO差不多吧。其实不论是心理学问题还是别的炎症疾病，最后导致死亡和自杀的数量都不少。不知道这个怎么就独独有那么多人在意”"}
