{"time": 1772635582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410083818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "588162808", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"谁知道，就和年轻人时兴的时髦一样吧。\"无所谓地摆摆手，\"就这么个感觉。\""}
{"time": 1772635596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "483654419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "588162808", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"本来每年自杀的人也够多了。\""}
{"time": 1772635830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "306146313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "588162808", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我只希望他们少干这种事，徒给我们增加工作量……”"}
